I guess I personally miss a bit more of that playful, carefree energy that makes me want to move without thinking too much. But that’s just me.

No disrespect at all though — I completely understand that not everything is meant for everyone, and people experience music in different ways. There’s definitely a lot in here that I genuinely enjoyed and a lot of moments that really stood out.

